        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail",
          "scroll": "page"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#f7f9fc;font-family:Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;min-height:100%;padding:4.4cqw 7cqw 5cqw'><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af'>Decision <span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.4cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.3cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#1e40af;border:1px solid #1e40af'>Open</span></div><div style='font:700 5.2cqw/1.12 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#1f2937'>When should Twilite launch?</div><div style='font:400 2.1cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:2cqw;max-width:62cqw'>Twilite has been under development for approximately sixteen months. Its graph-native architecture is established, and the editor, templates, and AI authoring workflow are functioning. The target is a first paying customer by Thanksgiving 2026. The challenge is deciding how much product readiness is enough before inviting customers.</div><div style='margin-top:2.6cqw;padding:1.4cqw 2cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:600 1.5cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>1 thing to check: Release readiness needs verification</div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(30,64,175,.35)'>Worth knowing</div><div style='margin-bottom:1.6cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Thanksgiving is the current target</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>The current goal is to acquire a paying customer by Thanksgiving, November 26, 2026. The intended minimum release includes a blank graph, task template, possibly one example, and initial canonical documentation. Signup, billing, and GitHub onboarding remain important release concerns.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:1.6cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Release readiness needs verification<span style='display:inline-block;margin-left:1cqw;padding:.2cqw 1cqw;border-radius:9cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle'>to check</span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>The graph model and AI authoring workflow have undergone extensive development, but the complete customer path from signup through payment and durable graph editing has not been independently verified here. This is an important unknown, not a claim that the path is broken.</div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(30,64,175,.35)'>What matters</div><div style='margin-bottom:1.8cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Speed to market <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#7e22ce;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Twilite has a potential head start in graph-native AI authoring. Reaching customers sooner may help establish a position before similar products appear.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:1.8cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Reliability and trust <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#7e22ce;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>A graph is durable user work, not a disposable demonstration. Customers must be able to create, modify, save, reopen, and share graphs without unexpected loss or corruption.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:1.8cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>First-use experience <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#7e22ce;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>An unfamiliar visitor should understand what Twilite does, create something meaningful, and experience AI collaboration without requiring the developer&#39;s personal guidance.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:1.8cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Scope and development effort <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#7e22ce;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>The release should avoid unnecessary architectural work, additional templates, and feature expansion. A focused product can continue maturing after launch.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:1.8cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Learning from customers <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#7e22ce;font-size:1.5cqw' title='medium'>●●<span style='opacity:.25'>●</span></span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Real users reveal problems that the creator cannot easily discover alone. A release should provide opportunities to observe actual use and learn what customers value.</div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(30,64,175,.35)'>The options</div><div style='margin-bottom:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.1cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Release immediately</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap'><span style='color:#15803d'>2 for</span> · <span style='color:#b91c1c'>2 against</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Open access to a small group of early adopters now. Present the product as an early release and improve it while people are using it. Keep expectations narrow and communicate current limitations.</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#15803d;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>+</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Speed to market</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#15803d;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · starts market exposure soonest</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#15803d;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>+</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Learning from customers</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#15803d;font-size:1.5cqw' title='medium'>●●<span style='opacity:.25'>●</span></span> · begins learning from users immediately</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#b91c1c;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>−</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Reliability and trust</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#b91c1c;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · less time to verify customer workflows</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#b91c1c;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>−</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>First-use experience</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#b91c1c;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · new users may need more guidance</span></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.1cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Launch by Thanksgiving</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap'><span style='color:#15803d'>3 for</span> · <span style='color:#b91c1c'>0 against</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Target November 26, 2026. Complete the essential onboarding, authentication, billing, and reliability work. Release with a blank graph, a task template, and a small amount of example content. Defer nonessential tutorials and enhancements.</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#15803d;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>+</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Speed to market</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#15803d;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · preserves the near-term target</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#15803d;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>+</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Scope and development effort</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#15803d;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · supports the planned minimum scope</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#15803d;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>+</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Learning from customers</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#15803d;font-size:1.5cqw' title='medium'>●●<span style='opacity:.25'>●</span></span> · begins feedback on the current schedule</span></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.1cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Launch in December</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap'><span style='color:#15803d'>2 for</span> · <span style='color:#b91c1c'>0 against</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Move the public release into December 2026. Use the additional time for onboarding, documentation, tutorials, and end-to-end testing. Set a definite revised date rather than extending development indefinitely.</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#15803d;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>+</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Reliability and trust</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#15803d;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · allows more end-to-end testing</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#15803d;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>+</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>First-use experience</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#15803d;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · more time for onboarding and tutorials</span></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.1cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Wait for broader readiness</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap'><span style='color:#15803d'>0 for</span> · <span style='color:#b91c1c'>3 against</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Do not commit to a calendar date. Release after a more complete tutorial library, polished templates, stronger validation, and broader feature coverage. Define explicit completion conditions before choosing this strategy.</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#b91c1c;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>−</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Speed to market</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#b91c1c;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · no defined date to enter the market</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#b91c1c;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>−</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Scope and development effort</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#b91c1c;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · encourages further scope expansion</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#b91c1c;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>−</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Learning from customers</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#b91c1c;font-size:1.5cqw' title='medium'>●●<span style='opacity:.25'>●</span></span> · delays independent user feedback</span></div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(30,64,175,.35)'>Where this landed</div><div style='font:italic 1.9cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#64748b'>Still open: no option has been chosen.</div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The Detail view: the page in full. The Method writes it from the masthead, the section and the routes, so edit those and not this.",
        "link": ""
      }
